{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"gloss-detail","href":"/shijing/gloss/078-da-shu-yu-tian/quwanli-quanshi/0001-1","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/gloss/078-da-shu-yu-tian/quwanli-quanshi/0001-1/data.json","title":"詩經詮釋 · 叔于田，乘乘马。执辔如组，两骖如舞。叔在薮，火烈具举。袒裼暴虎，献于公所。将叔无狃，戒其伤女。叔于田，乘乘黄。两服上襄，两骖雁行。叔在薮，火烈具扬。叔善射忌，又良御忌。抑磬控忌，抑纵送忌。叔于田，乘乘鸨。两服齐首，两骖如手。叔在薮，火烈具阜。叔马慢忌，叔发罕忌。抑释掤忌，抑鬯弓忌。 · 屈万里 · 注释","description":"風 · 鄭風 · 大叔于田 · 《詩經詮釋》关于“叔于田，乘乘马。执辔如组，两骖如舞。叔在薮，火烈…”的注脚：屈万里以《大叔于田》亦为美共叔段之诗，并据《释文》指出篇名本作《叔于田》，后人加“大”以别前篇，又随文解释乘乘马、两服、两骖等猎行语词。"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"078-da-shu-yu-tian","materialId":"quwanli-quanshi","glossId":"0001-1"},"href":"/shijing/gloss/078-da-shu-yu-tian/quwanli-quanshi/0001-1","poem":{"id":"078-da-shu-yu-tian","title":"大叔于田","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"zhengfeng","path":["風","鄭風","大叔于田"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"叔于田","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-002","text":"乘乘马","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-003","text":"执辔如组","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-004","text":"两骖如舞","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-005","text":"叔在薮","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-006","text":"火烈具举","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-007","text":"袒裼暴虎","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-008","text":"献于公所","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-009","text":"将叔无狃","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-010","text":"戒其伤女","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-011","text":"叔于田","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-012","text":"乘乘黄","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-013","text":"两服上襄","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-014","text":"两骖雁行","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-015","text":"叔在薮","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-016","text":"火烈具扬","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-017","text":"叔善射忌","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-018","text":"又良御忌","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-019","text":"抑磬控忌","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-020","text":"抑纵送忌","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-021","text":"叔于田","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-022","text":"乘乘鸨","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-023","text":"两服齐首","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-024","text":"两骖如手","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-025","text":"叔在薮","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-026",